'''Jude Ciccolella''' {{born|30|November|1947}}, born '''Richard Jude Ciccolella''', is the actor who played [[Suran]] in {{film|10}}. He was born on the same day as ''Nemesis'' director [[Stuart Baird]].

He has made appearances in many other films, including {{wt|Morgan Stewart's Coming Home}} (1987, with [[JD Cullum]]), {{wt|The Shawshank Redemption}} (1994, with [[Bill Bolender]], [[Brian Brophy]], [[Clancy Brown]], [[Bob Gunton]], [[Mark Rolston]] and [[William Sadler]]), {{wt|Boys on the Side}} (starring [[Whoopi Goldberg]], [[Aaron Lustig]], [[Stephen Gevedon]] and [[Mary Anne McGarry]]), {{wt|High Crimes}} (2002, with [[Ashley Judd]], [[Bruce Davison]] and [[John Billingsley]]), {{wt|Down with Love}} (2002, with [[Rachel Dratch]], [[Melissa George]], [[Jeri Ryan]], [[Warren Munson]], [[Michael Ensign]], [[Diana R. Lupo]] and [[David Doty]]), {{wt|The Terminal}} (2004, starring [[Tom Hanks]], with [[Michael Nouri]] and [[Zoë Saldana]]), {{wt|The Manchurian Candidate (2004 film)|The Manchurian Candidate}} (2004, starring [[Jon Voight]], with [[Charles Napier]], [[Dean Stockwell]], and [[Miguel Ferrer]]), and {{wt|Sin City (film)|Sin City}} (2005). He also had an uncredited part as Hogan in {{wt|Million Dollar Baby}}, which also featured [[Lucia Rijker]], [[Benito Martinez]], [[Tom McCleister]], [[Jamison Yang]], [[Miguel Perez]], [[Marco Rodriguez]], [[Spice Williams]], [[Rosine "Ace" Hatem]], [[Bridgett Riley]] and [[Boni Yanagisawa]].

However, he is probably best known for his role as Mike Novick on {{wt|24 (TV series)|24}}. He worked with a number of other ''Star Trek'' actors, including his ''Nemesis'' co-star [[Alan Dale]] as well as [[Penny Johnson]], [[Gregory Itzin]], [[Michelle Forbes]], [[Glenn Morshower]], [[Harris Yulin]], and [[Ray Wise]].

He later appeared in the fourth season finale of {{wt|Boston Legal}}, starring [[William Shatner]] and [[John Larroquette]]. Ciccolella's episode, entitled "Patriot Acts", also guest-starred [[Henry Gibson]] and [[Richard McGonagle]]. He has also appeared in {{wt|NCIS: New Orleans}} alongside [[Scott Bakula]].

